    <h1>Tiny House Kits vs Plans: Which Is Cheaper to Build?</h1>
    <p class="lead">A tiny house kit ships you the shell materials; a set of plans gives you the drawings and leaves the buying to you. Here is what each one really includes, what they typically cost, and how to decide which path fits your budget, skills and site.</p>
